+/**
+ * @brief The layer's damage pre-pass, in layer space.
+ *
+ * Damage on the viewport's bands, or ER_LAYER_LIVE_BANDS from them, is painted this commit. Farther away it
+ * only marks its bands stale, to be painted by prefetch once they are quiet or when scrolled into view, so
+ * an animation or a layout shift off screen costs no raster. A plain node's footprint is then recorded as if
+ * it had been painted, which is what that band repaint will do; a transformed one stays dirty and marks its
+ * bands again on every commit until a repaint reaches it.
